                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1571" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1614">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What I mean is... we are distant relatives because we are related like this: my grandfather from my mom's side...  </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
